67H273.066667c-12.8 0-25.6 4.266667-38.4 17.066666-4.266667 8.533333-12.8 21.333333-12.8 34.133334v567.466666c0 12.8 4.266667 25.6 17.066666 38.4s21.333333 17.066667 34.133334 17.066667h473.6c12.8 0 25.6-4.266667 38.4-17.066667 8.533333-8.533333 17.066667-21.333333 17.066666-38.4V273.066667c0-12.8-4.266667-25.6-17.066666-38.4-8.533333-8.533333-21.333333-17.066667-38.4-17.066667h-59.733334c-8.533333 21.333333-17.066667 38.4-34.133333 55.466667-25.6 25.6-59.733333 38.4-98.133333 38.4h-93.866667c-38.4 0-72.533333-12.8-98.133333-38.4-12.8-12.8-21.333333-29.866667-29.866667-51.2z"></path></svg></span><span class="ml-1">Copy Page</span></span></button><button type="button" class="ui-btn ui-btn-default ui-btn-flex ui-btn-sm ui-btn-icon-only ui-btn-compact-item ui-btn-compact-last-item ui-dropdown-trigger"><span role="img" class="appicon app_icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img"><path d="M225.834667 353.834667a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 60.330666 0L512 579.669333l225.834667-225.834666a42.666667 42.666667 0 1 1 60.330666 60.330666l-256 256a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1-60.330666 0l-256-256a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 0-60.330666z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4"><div class="flex w-0 flex-1 gap-2"><h1 class="text-[32px] font-600 leading-10 text-color" title="Introduction">Introduction</h1></div></div><div class="_markdown-container_txmk1_1 mb-8"><div class="markdown-body remark-mdx"><section data-first="true">KuCoin Futures currently offers two types of products:</section><section>USDT-Margined Futures: Also known as forward contracts, settled in USDT or USDC. For example, in the BTC Perpetual/USDT futures, BTC is the base currency (the currency being traded), and USDT is the settlement currency (used to buy the futures and calculate position PNL).</section><section>Coin-Margined Futures: Also known as inverse contracts, settled in cryptocurrencies. For example, the BTC-margined (BTC Perpetual-USD) future has BTC as both the base and settlement currency.</section><section><strong data-first="true" data-last="true">FAQ Guidelines</strong></section><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root" data-last="true"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="0" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">How to Use Kucoin Futures Cross Margin Via API<br/><a href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/47497300093771" title="" data-last="true" data-href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/47497300093771" target="_blank">https://www.kucoin.com/support/47497300093771</a></section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="1" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">What is Cross Margin Mode<br/><a href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/35081196925209" title="" data-last="true" data-href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/35081196925209" target="_blank">https://www.kucoin.com/support/35081196925209</a></section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="2" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">Advantages of Cross Margin Mode<br/><a href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/35084093025049" title="" data-last="true" data-href="https://www.kucoin.com/support/35084093025049" target="_blank">https://www.kucoin.com/support/35084093025049</a></section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="3" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6r